{
  "$schema": "./icon-map.schema",
  "_doc": [
    "Canonical icon-name map for <ui-icon name=\"...\">. Generated + hand-verified in step S2 of the",
    "PrimeNG->spartan migration. Every target was checked to exist in @ng-icons/lucide (1987 exports).",
    "KEY   = the name a call site writes (legacy primeicons name, or an already-lucide kebab name).",
    "VALUE = the lucide kebab name. tools/gen-icon-registry.mjs turns these into the UiIconName union",
    "        and the per-app provideIcons() registries.",
    "brand-* targets are NOT lucide (lucide ships no brand icons); they are hand-vendored SVG strings",
    "in projects/shared/src/lib/ui/icons/brand-icons.ts and registered the same way.",
    "NOT ICONS, deliberately absent: \"spin\" (a primeicons CSS keyframe, not a glyph -> use <ui-icon spin>).",
    "The trailing block of identity entries (banknote..trending-up) are already-lucide names written",
    "directly by the DYNAMIC icon call sites (sidebar-items.ts nav data, the ui-lab grid). They must be",
    "in the map because resolveNgIcon() no longer falls through unknown names -- it renders an error glyph."
  ],
